Honcho Inspector is a multi-user admin dashboard for the Honcho AI
memory layer. It pairs a Java/Spring Boot backend (REST API, SQLite
storage, Honcho proxy) with an Angular view-only frontend.

This is a META-PACKAGE. It does not install any files of its own --
it depends on both component packages and pulls them in as transitive
dependencies when the operator runs `pkg install honcho-inspector`.

Components installed by this meta-package:
  - net/honcho-inspector        Backend service (Java 25, Spring Boot 3.5)
  - www/honcho-inspector-frontend  Frontend service (Angular)

After installation:
  - Enable the backend:    sysrc honcho_inspector_enable=YES
  - Enable the frontend:   sysrc honcho_inspector_frontend_enable=YES
  - Start both:            service honcho_inspector start && service honcho_inspector_frontend start
  - See each component's pkg-descr for its own configuration, env-file
    locations, and service-management details.

WWW: https://github.com/cloudbsdorg/honcho-inspector-backend
